      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    remaining_principal = 150000\n    index_rate = 0.02\n    bank_margin = 0.015\n    remaining_term_months = 10 * 12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    fully_indexed_rate = index_rate + bank_margin\n    monthly_rate = fully_indexed_rate / 12\n    monthly_payment = remaining_principal * (\n        monthly_rate * (1 + monthly_rate) ** remaining_term_months\n    ) / ((1 + monthly_rate) ** remaining_term_months - 1)\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(monthly_payment, 2)\n```",
